// The account's menu, its pages and the Bookings page, in every language the site speaks (the website's /account, /account/*
// and /bookings, 2026-11-19: "i want the account page to be very similar on main for it on booking app"). Kept apart from
// the site's translation dictionaries as the wallet's are (Wallet.words.ts): the ten languages the booking app speaks take
// its own wording, word for word (its accPg*, acc*, del*, accPwd*, custPurch*, ambMine* keys and company-challenge.js's
// words); Indonesian, Malay, German, Russian, Chinese and Japanese, which it does not speak, follow
// src/i18n/TRANSLATING.md. The few the app has no words for (workshop, clubCard, pastWorkshop) are the site's
// own. Generated once from the booking app's files; change a text in every language at once.
